    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make us strong again, global food is now under the strictest regulation!<br>\u2014 Town of Arik\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a homeless wanderer, cast onto the streets by disaster. By chance, you discover your cooking is incredibly delicious. Perhaps, with this skill, you can help those in need.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearby, Barber Town has just endured the ravages of war, and its residents urgently need food. In Arik Town, where the strictest food regulations are enforced, you realize this will be a risky mission.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to navigate tightening laws, underground black markets, and secretly prepare gourmet dishes. Break through layers of blockades to personally deliver food to those awaiting aid. Let warmth and hope spread to every corner of the world through your cooking.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a series of delicious meals, each with unique techniques and flavors. Explore hidden recipes to cook dishes with special effects.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, ride a dog, or drive through the city to safely deliver your products to customers. You can also hire like-minded partners to assist with distribution.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone, but danger is everywhere\u2014use your fists, melee weapons, or firearms to fend off sudden attacks from black market operatives and ever-patrolling Arik Town soldiers.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own safe house to withstand surprise inspections. When necessary, fight back!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make us strong again, global food is now under the strictest regulation!<br>\u2014 Town of Arik\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a homeless wanderer, cast onto the streets by disaster. By chance, you discover your cooking is incredibly delicious. Perhaps, with this skill, you can help those in need.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearby, Barber Town has just endured the ravages of war, and its residents urgently need food. In Arik Town, where the strictest food regulations are enforced, you realize this will be a risky mission.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to navigate tightening laws, underground black markets, and secretly prepare gourmet dishes. Break through layers of blockades to personally deliver food to those awaiting aid. Let warmth and hope spread to every corner of the world through your cooking.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a series of delicious meals, each with unique techniques and flavors. Explore hidden recipes to cook dishes with special effects.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, ride a dog, or drive through the city to safely deliver your products to customers. You can also hire like-minded partners to assist with distribution.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone, but danger is everywhere\u2014use your fists, melee weapons, or firearms to fend off sudden attacks from black market operatives and ever-patrolling Arik Town soldiers.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own safe house to withstand surprise inspections. When necessary, fight back!</p>",
